# ClearWay environment configuration
#
# Copy this file to ".env" if you want to override any setting, then load it
# with python-dotenv. ClearWay is NOT tracked in git and MUST NOT be
# committed - it is listed in .gitignore.
#
# CURRENT STATUS: ClearWay needs NO API keys. Geocoding uses the public
# OpenStreetMap Nominatim service and routing uses the community
# "routed-foot" endpoint, both described in src/geocoding.py and src/routing.py.
# The variables below are optional and only needed if you switch to a keyed
# provider such as OpenRouteService.
#
# ---- OPTIONAL: only if you upgrade to a keyed routing provider -------------
# Do not put real keys in this file in a public repository. Add them to a
# local .env that is git-ignored, and never to frontend code.
# OPENROUTESERVICE_API_KEY=
# ROUTING_API_KEY=
#
# ---- OPTIONAL: pattern for a keyed geocoder -------------------------------
# GEOCODING_API_KEY=
